%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Pages: 2
%%Page: 1 1
72 720 moveto /Times-Bold findfont 18 scalefont setfont (A PostScript letter) show
/Times-Roman findfont 11 scalefont setfont
72 690 moveto (Dear reader, this page was written in PostScript and distilled by Ghostscript.) show
72 675 moveto 2 0 32 (Widthshow stretches every space by two points here.) widthshow
72 660 moveto 0.5 0 (Ashow letterspaces each glyph.) ashow
72 645 moveto (Kerned: ) show [(A) -80 (V) -80 (A)] pop (AVA) show
72 630 moveto /Courier findfont 10 scalefont setfont (Monospace: 0123456789 {braces} [brackets]) show
/Helvetica findfont 11 scalefont setfont
gsave 300 400 translate 30 rotate 0 0 moveto (Rotated thirty degrees) show grestore
gsave 500 300 translate 90 rotate 0 0 moveto (Rotated ninety degrees) show grestore
72 200 moveto (Accents via StandardEncoding: caf) show (\302) show (e) show
/Symbol findfont 11 scalefont setfont 72 180 moveto (a b g d \245 \263) show
showpage
%%Page: 2 2
/Helvetica-Oblique findfont 11 scalefont setfont
72 720 moveto (Second page, oblique.) show
showpage
